WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:06.560
<i>Ryang-Ha Song: an assassin of unknown 
origin and unknown affiliation.</i>

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.170
<b>This program is a work of fiction. The characters, organizations, locations, cases, etc. being portrayed are unrelated to actual events.</b>

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:12.880
<i>He was responsible for the dissolution of 
the Santoukai, a powerful Far East mafia,</i>

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.070
<i>which dealt a great blow 
to the underground world.</i>

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:22.780
<i>To this day, several organizations 
have a bounty on his head.</i>

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.210
<i>Chateau Dankworth of 
Ritzland Support Company.</i>

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:34.220
<i>A new member at her organization, she's had 
several transactions with Ryang-Ha Song.</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.260
<i>Evidence suggests she was 
involved in a crime as a child.</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.440
<i>She remembers nothing other than her name.</i>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>These two were destined to meet,</i>

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:54.400
<i>like the wind and rain that 
bring storms to the skies.</i>

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:25.310
Ryang-Ha.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.930
That's your name now.

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:37.110
I hope you like it.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:41.940
Nice to meet you.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:45.870
I'm here to take you home, Ryang-Ha Song.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:30.480
3 Hours After Departure

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:37.260
We hope you all enjoy the voyage.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.890
Scheduled report.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.620
No problems at the assembly hall stage.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.080
<i>Assembly hall center.</i>

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.890
<i>Nothing out of the ordinary here.</i>

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:57.380
Actually, I've lost sight of our target.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.630
Where are you, Boss?

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.310
Oh, sorry.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.140
I'm at the upstairs ballroom.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.660
Across from the stage...

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.640
Honey, there's the hotel manager.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.630
I'd like to go and say hi.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.060
May we?

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.520
Um...

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.710
<i>Target is on the move!</i>

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.480
I was shocked.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.130
I know.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.080
I didn't think our client would be a woman.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.910
No, no. I mean the fact that...

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:33.150
<i>Actually... they're a relative of mine.</i>

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:36.500
I was wondering why he was being so vague.

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:37.860
And you are?

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:40.840
Oh, my. Pardon the late introduction.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.320
This is my husband.

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:46.620
Th-Thank you for taking care of my wife.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:50.520
You seem like a dependable husband.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.070
I envy how close you two seem to be.

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:54.550
Oh, please.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.570
Hawk Ritzland.

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:01.700
Born to the successful Galbantos family,

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:05.550
she founded her own business 
at the young age of twenty.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:08.700
Her net worth is supposedly 
in the tens of billions.

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:13.250
He really struck gold.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.510
Look at them, being all 
mushy and lovey-dovey.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.280
"Anyway, stay sharp."

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.590
My ass!

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.430
I'm going to need to be 
piss drunk to get through this.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:26.950
What about you?

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.770
No, I'm fine.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:41.520
What's that? You're drinking <i>juice</i>?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.100
Chateau?

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.950
What? Huh?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.030
<i>Chateau? Hello?</i>

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:53.650
<i>Are you in the bathroom?</i>

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:55.720
Hey, now...

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.450
Where are we going?

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.060
Are you that desperate to get me alone?

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.990
Oh, you!

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:05.130
Oh.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.220
Why are you here?

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.600
What are you here to do?

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.830
Well... What do you think?

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:24.730
Can you imagine if my target 
happens to be your client?

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:29.740
And now you can't just let me loose, can you?

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:33.620
So I have a proposition.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:38.350
As long as you're watching me, 
I won't do anything.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.620
I'll stay put.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:40.870
What?

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.380
That's ridiculous.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.070
Do you really expect me to believe you?

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:51.740
But we're here right now because 
you wanted to talk, right?

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.510
Otherwise, we would have 
gotten into a brawl by now.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:02.900
You want the boss and his wife to 
have a peaceful trip, don't you?

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.150
So what'll it be?

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:09.890
You're just messing with me, aren't you?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:12.270
Can't say that's not part of it.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:19.540
In any case, it's up to you whether 
you want to deal with me.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.760
So what are you going to do?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:30.050
7 Hours After Departure

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:35.080
Honey, I'm about to go to bed.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.570
Are you still working?

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:38.070
Oh, yeah.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:38.990
Sorry.

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:40.810
Don't stay up too long.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:52.990
<i>I can't believe he'd come in contact 
with us all the way out at sea.</i>

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.580
That camera can't be fair game, can it?

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.070
Don't mind it.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.790
It's just a piece of decor.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.220
That's a bit of a stretch.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.920
Who's spying on us?

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.480
I'm not obligated to answer.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.250
Why don't you go to sleep now?

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:11.130
<i>You gonna sleep next to me?</i>

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:11.960
<i>I will not.</i>

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:14.640
<i>I'll rest on the sofa. Please take the bed.</i>

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.140
<i>What? But it's a double bed.</i>

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.950
We can't just leave him be.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:25.150
It'll be too late once he causes a problem.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.850
<i>Your wife's safety is our top priority.</i>

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:32.410
<i>I suggest we take his offer and 
get through this without incident.</i>

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.650
His offer?

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.820
He's asking for a cruise card and a cabin.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:40.790
He's also demanding that I 
accompany him during the voyage.

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:44.440
<i>This could be a good opportunity
 for us to observe him.</i>

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:47.370
<i>I'll report any suspicious 
behavior immediately.</i>

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.350
<i>And you're okay with that, Chateau?</i>

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:54.300
I'll tolerate it.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.300
<i>She'll tolerate it, huh?</i>

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:01.930
Besides, I'm probably the one 
who brought him here, in effect.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:08.940
I'll do all I can to avoid 
causing any more problems.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:13.500
<i>What can we do?</i>

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.500
Aren't you going to sleep?

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.950
If you're worried about watching me,

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.450
I'll agree not to do anything 
while you're asleep.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:26.150
Or are you waiting for me
 to make a move on you?

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:26.750
What?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.540
Nothing!

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:35.380
Do you have trouble sleeping because 
you have bad dreams or something?

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:46.860
Goodnight.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:50.580
Honey.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.070
Hey, honey...

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:56.490
Oh, you're still up?

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.550
No.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.570
I just woke up.

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:02.590
Why don't you get some sleep already?

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:05.640
There are guards outside our room.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.710
I'm fine. Don't mind me.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:11.380
I'll make you some tea, then.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.210
Oh, thanks.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.440
Oh, dear.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.000
So you can't sleep after all.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:43.030
You need to sleep when you can,
or you're going to get sick.

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:45.750
Just use the bed.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.850
It's better than the sofa, no?

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.540
Don't mind me.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.130
I never said we need to sleep together.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.200
I'll sleep on the sofa.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:59.050
Leave me alone.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:03.670
I'm just not sleeping very well lately.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:05.310
Really, I'm fine.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.560
Jeez.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.570
Come on. I want that spot.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.200
Fine, I'll have to resort to force.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.500
Hey, now.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.830
It's the middle of the night. Be quiet.

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:33.830
A-All right! I'll move! I will!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.480
Time's up.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:37.960
I'm evicting you now.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:40.140
There, new land.

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:41.770
It's nice, isn't it?

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.240
Are you satisfied now?

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:48.860
What? I can mess with you until I'm satisfied?

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:50.740
I'm just messing around.

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:52.510
It was only a joke.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:55.810
I'm getting tired. I'm going to sleep.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:58.300
Goodnight.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:01.810
Yeah, goodnight.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:07.830
Time out, time out.

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:10.000
What are you trying to do?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.830
Trust me, I'm not planning 
on doing anything bad.

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.930
You're going to sleep, right?

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:19.990
I'll go rest on the sofa once you're asleep.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:23.970
So goodnight already.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:30.590
Or does your heart race too much 
to sleep when I'm next to you?

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:31.430
What?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.150
See, you're fine, aren't you?

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.650
Goodnight, then!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.230
This is stupid.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.720
Why do you always...

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:53.250
do such silly...

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:17.160
She falls asleep so fast.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.880
She sure does trust me an awful lot.

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.830
I thought she looked pale.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.950
She must have been sleep-deprived.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:36.940
Goodnight.

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:05.250
Boss, I can't do this anymore.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:08.570
Those two are just flirting.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.160
Let me take a nap.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.140
Good morning.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:27.880
You really aren't a morning person, are you?

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.820
Whee! Whee!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.880
Huh? You didn't bring any other clothes?

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:39.050
I only brought spare suits.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.490
That's no good.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.900
Surely you must know the dress code.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:48.410
You stood out at the ceremony last night, too.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:52.610
You were supposed to blend in 
with the guests, weren't you?

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:56.370
Yet you were wandering around 
on your own in a black pantsuit.

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.310
You didn't fit in at all.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:14:59.920
You can't do that.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.320
So, why don't we get you sorted out?

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.270
Huh?

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:09.260
18 Hours After Departure

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.900
Yes? Hello?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:25.270
<i>Chateau, you have to stay on the ball.</i>

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.530
You missed your scheduled report.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:32.420
We tour the port town until two. Then we 
attend the hotel owner evaluation meeting.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:32.420
These two seem to be enjoying their date.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.280
How are things over there?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.570
F-Fine.

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.460
There's nothing wrong here.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.620
Hey, are you done yet?

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.040
Oh! Do you not know how to put it on?

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.940
I-I do.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:42.920
Are you sure?

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.540
If you do, you ought to be done by now.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.170
Okay, I'm coming in.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.420
H-Hey, wai—

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:51.220
<i>The big reveal!</i>

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:58.500
Jim, how is she?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:02.490
She's doing just peachy.

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:08.680
Boss, I have some good news.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.860
We've got some backup coming.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:14.530
We rendezvous with them this afternoon.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:16.710
I see.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.650
The hemline's a bit long, don't you think?

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:32.310
Could you turn this way?

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:33.800
Uh...

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:38.150
I-I think I could do with something 
a little more modest.

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:40.550
I can't get over how 
exposed my shoulders are.

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:41.680
Nope.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.560
That's already pretty modest 
for an evening gown.

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:46.860
Then something a little 
easier to move around in?

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.780
You don't need to worry about that.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:50.360
Let's get that hemmed up.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.280
Come on.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:00.680
Yeah, the hemline's definitely too long.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.210
Can you wear heels?

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:05.480
Have you decided?

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.790
We'll take it!

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:23.730
Man, it's hard to believe 
this is the inside of a ship.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:26.400
You can buy dresses and shoes here.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.840
They even deliver them to your room.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:32.470
Tomorrow's the formal night, isn't it?

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:34.100
I can't wait.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.720
I think I'll wear a tux myself.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.410
Something seems off about you today.

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:44.450
You haven't put up a fight 
over hanging out with me.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.210
Is something wrong?

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:53.210
You're the one doing the 
surveilling, aren't you?

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.090
You're watching me.

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:01.960
That's an awful thing to say.

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:02.720
I'm...

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:08.390
Yes?

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:09.480
<i>Chateau?</i>

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:11.570
Sorry to interrupt.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.470
<i>It's a bit early for my scheduled report.</i>

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.240
We need to talk.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:20.370
<i>We got two additional guards.</i>

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.750
<i>We can fill your spot.</i>

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:23.840
<i>So...</i>

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:27.500
What?

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:29.370
Why?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.470
What is it? Something up?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.300
He wants to talk to you.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:41.490
Nice to meet you.

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:44.720
I'm Euripedes Ritzland, 
the representative of our company.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:45.820
<i>Hello.</i>

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.770
<i>Can we keep this quick, please?</i>

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:50.520
Before I get into it, one thing.

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:55.530
<i>We currently have no 
intention of going after you.</i>

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.530
<i>Of course, that may change 
with the circumstances.</i>

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:03.080
Dankworth has told me about 
her interactions with you.

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:07.010
To be honest, I'd like to carry on
 pretending not to have known.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:09.040
I hope you understand.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.830
Yeah?

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:11.790
So...

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:13.540
<i>What's your business?</i>

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.380
Chateau Noble.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:21.510
<i>Does that name ring a bell?</i>

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:26.970
<i>Chateau... She doesn't know anything.</i>

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:30.940
<i>She apparently doesn't remember 
much about what happened.</i>

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:34.150
<i>Could you...</i>

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:36.660
spare some time, perhaps tonight?

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.280
Here they come.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.720
It's Mr. José and Mr. Cedran!

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:49.790
Just in time for departure.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:53.200
Jim, do you mind taking over for a while?

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.830
Huh? Why?

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:55.890
I have some business.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:56.540
Okay...

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:33.270
<i>I should have brought someone with me.</i>

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:39.240
<i>I don't even know if Ryang-Ha 
Song listens to reason.</i>

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:43.720
<i>But I can't go on ignoring 
this situation, either way.</i>

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:58.490
<i>I need to make clear who Ryang-Ha Song is,</i>

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:02.110
<i>and the truth about Chateau herself.</i>

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.880
He's gone?

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.560
Song is?

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.880
<i>Sorry, I let my guard down.</i>

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:24.880
<i>Where's the boss?</i>

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:27.390
Actually...

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:30.640
<i>The boss just left a while ago, too.</i>

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:33.500
<i>He's gone radio silent.</i>

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:35.720
<i>Hmm?</i>

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.600
<i>He just wanted to make sure of a few things.</i>

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:41.670
That call...

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:48.410
<i>Boss? Please respond!</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.900
<i>Boss, it's Jim.</i>

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:51.910
<i>Boss...</i>

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.320
<i>Boss!</i>

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:39.450
Next episode: "Bullet."
